    kind: work_item  # 7680
    title: "Five more analyzers emit dangling dsts with too few id slots (json_config defines_target, make depends_on, jsonnet imports + file ids, astro and svelte imports), the same <unknown>-slot fallback INV-dulah's lang-slot limb names"  # 7680
    status: todo_hard  # 7680
    priority: 3  # 7680
    parent:  # 7680
    tags:  # 7680
