  message: "Cross-ref from WI-majov (2026-10-01): the svelte.py:237 bare-path site listed here also has a SECOND defect beyond the id-slot shape. The import names an existing in-repo file, but the edge lands on a phantom external_symbol instead of that file's node. Filed separately as WI-modan-tizob-bilag-fanas-simip-guzuz-homoj-rimut, with a repro covering svelte, vue, the js_ts phantom import, and vue-component-linker labelling a .svelte file as vue. Fixing only the slot count here would leave that phantom canonical-looking, not resolved."  # 03ff
