  clock: 3  # 3e8b
  nonce: 3e8b  # 3e8b
  message: "Cross-ref from WI-pifus (2026-10-01, local branch jgstern-agent/fix/pifus, commit f13f35fb0f, not yet integrated): astro.py's _AstroFileExtractor no longer takes repo_root; it takes the rel_path the base class computed, and the `path: Path` parameter is gone from extract/_process_tag/_parse_frontmatter_js and the other per-file helpers. Before that fix every astro src/file id carried the analysis root's own directory name as a leading component (astroroot/src/Page.astro instead of src/Page.astro). Two consequences for this item: (1) a branch editing the astro.py:314 bare-path site will textually conflict with WI-pifus in _process_tag (same hunk region; the line numbers cited here moved by about -10 on that branch); (2) resolving an astro import such as ./Header.astro to the imported file's node needs the importer's root-relative path, which is only correct after WI-pifus. The 4 astro edges counted here were measured on the pre-fix code: their dst is the raw import path and is unaffected by WI-pifus, but their src file ids carried the wrong path."  # 3e8b
